abcbbox, titlebbox : bool, default: [abc.bbox](https://ultraplot.readthedocs.io/en/stable/search.html?q=abc.bbox) and [title.bbox](https://ultraplot.readthedocs.io/en/stable/search.html?q=title.bbox)
